          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TL 00 SE            ABBOTS LANGLEY         HIGH STREET (East side) Bedmond 3/44                                       The Bell Public House II Public house. C17, refronted in C18, altered C19 and C20. Timber frame, possibly brick cased. Rendered. Tiled roof. 3 bays. 2 storeys. Entrances flanking central bay, horizontal 4 light casement to centre and outer C19 flush frame sashes on ground floor, that to left with a cambered head. Three first floor horizontal sliding sashes. Exposed plates and purlins in gable ends. Rendered external end stacks, that to left with tiled offsets. Catslide roof over continuous lean-to rear outshut. To right a 1 storey weatherboarded outbuilding, a window to front, entrance in return, lean-to outshut to rear. C20 1 storey extension to rear. Interior not inspected. Listing NGR: TL0990503543"
    }
  ],
